---
name: Sriracha Mezcal Cocktail
ingredients:
  - type: Mezcal
    amount: '2'
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Lime juice
    amount: '4'
    unit: tsp
    garnish: false
  - type: Sprite
    amount: '6'
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Sriracha
    amount: '2'
    unit: tsp
    garnish: false
category:
  - tequila
image: ../../images/cocktails/sriracha-mezcal-cocktail/image.jpg
sourceUrl: https://patijinich.com/sriracha-mezcal-cocktail/
---
1. Mix the mezcal, lime juice, soda and Sriracha sauce in a glass. Stir well and top with ice.

Alternate options for Sprite: Spindrift (lime or lemon), LaCroix, or Topo Chico.\
